<main class="home">
  <h1>Buzz Buzz</h1>
  <p class="tagline">Make words from seven letters. Pick a way to play.</p>

  <a class="mode-card" href="/daily/">
    <span class="mode-name">Daily</span>
    <span class="mode-detail">A new puzzle every day. Climb the ranks to Genius.</span>
  </a>
  <a class="mode-card" href="/puzzles/">
    <span class="mode-name">Puzzles</span>
    <span class="mode-detail">Find the hidden pangram to unlock the next puzzle.</span>
  </a>
  <a class="mode-card" href="/wager/">
    <span class="mode-name">Wager</span>
    <span class="mode-detail">Bet buzz coins and race the clock to find the pangram.</span>
  </a>

  <section class="how-to-play">
    <h2>How to play</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Words must be at least 4 letters long.</li>
      <li>Every word must use the center letter.</li>
      <li>Letters can be used more than once.</li>
      <li>4-letter words are worth 1 point. Longer words are worth 1 point per letter.</li>
      <li>A <strong>pangram</strong> uses all 7 letters, and earns 7 bonus points.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <p class="credits">
    Based on <a href="https://github.com/Gyanreyer/open-spelling-bee">Open Spelling Bee</a>
    by Ryan Geyer, MIT license.
  </p>
</main>

